    "title": "Framework for the Provision of Siemens Equipment, Software and Other Services",
    "description": "The following areas goods and services are included in the scope of this Framework:\r\n\r\n• Provision of all Siemens current products, equipment and digital solutions and any future products, equipment and digital solutions which may come to market during the term of this Framework.\r\n\r\n• Consultancy and Implementation Services for Siemens current products, equipment and digital solutions. With the ability to provide turnkey solutions.\r\n\r\n• Maintenance of all current products, equipment and digital solutions. Including upgrades and patches to IT based solutions.\r\n\r\n• Training of staff to use products, equipment and digital solutions efficiently, and the ability to have refresher training if required.\r\n\r\nAdditional information: Notice previously failed to publish via E-Tendering portal. This notice is just for administrative purposes. \r\n\r\nPublication was made on Find a Tender on 21st Feb 2025.\r\nhttps://www.find-tender.service.gov.uk/Notice/006798-2025?",
